  "summary": "This experiment tested concat fusion with scvi_n200 RNA and ViT-L image encoders, transformer aggregation, achieving validation accuracy of 0.7207 and F1 of 0.6815, slightly lower than the weighted fusion baseline (config_039: 0.7250 accuracy, 0.6847 F1). The results suggest concat fusion may be less effective than weighted fusion in this setup, but the relative impact of fusion strategies remains uncertain without further comparative analysis."
